<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn fed cattle not well tested - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn fed cattle not well tested - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iowa and southern Minnesota direct cattle markets as of 1100 CST were lightly tested on a dressed basis.</p>
<p>Reported sales for Thursday: 200 Week to Date:  11300</p>
<p>Live basis: Steers and heifers not tested.</p>
<p>Carcass basis: Steers not tested with heifers not well tested.</p>
<p>Heifers: Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1025 lbs  few 109.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
